    "sections": {
        "description": "The Transport Freight theme is designed with organized sections for presenting freight services, shipment details, delivery information, and logistics-related content in a structured layout. It includes customizable banner areas, service sections, route information blocks, testimonials, and contact integration for clear communication. The homepage supports content arrangement for fleet details, transport updates, service coverage, and project information. The theme also provides navigation menus, blog support, image display sections, social media integration, and footer customization options. Its responsive structure helps maintain accessibility across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices. Additional customization settings for typography, colors, and layout arrangement allow flexible content presentation while keeping the website layout clean and easy to navigate. Demo: https://preview.themescaliber.com/tc-logistics-transport-pro/"
    },
